<title>USA: First Financial to buy back 10 pct of stock.</title>
<headline>First Financial to buy back 10 pct of stock.</headline>
<dateline>BELVIDERE, Ill. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Financial Bancorp Inc, the Illinois-based holding company for First Federal Savings Bank, said Monday it intends to repurchase up to 45,231 shares, or 10 percent of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company has been authorized by its board of directors to buy back the shares over the next 12 months. The repurchases will be made in the open market and possibly through unsolicited negotiated transactions, the company said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
